<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>월드컵 예측 마켓 기능정의서</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .topbar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      height: 56px;
      background: #00143F;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 20px;
      z-index: 1000;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .topbar-logo {
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .topbar-version {
      margin-left: auto;
      color: #ccc;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .sidebar {
      position: fixed;
      left: 0;
      top: 56px;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 240px;
      background: white;
      border-right: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
      padding: 20px 0;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .sidebar-group {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .sidebar-group-label {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #999;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .sidebar-item {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    }

    .sidebar-item:hover {
      background: #f8f8f8;
      color: #333;
    }

    .sidebar-item.active {
      background: #f0f4ff;
      color: #1F30E9;
      border-left-color: #1F30E9;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .sidebar-item-id {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 40px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1F30E9;
      margin-right: 8px;
    }

    .sidebar-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: #e8e8e8;
      margin: 8px 0;
    }

    .layout {
      margin-left: 240px;
      margin-top: 56px;
    }

    .main {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px;
      background: white;
    }

    .cover {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 60px 40px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e8e8e8;
    }

    .cover-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      background: #f0f4ff;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1F30E9;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .cover h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .cover-sub {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .cover-meta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 40px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #999;
    }

    .cover-meta-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .cover-meta-item span:first-child {
      color: #666;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .legend {
      display: flex;
      gap: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #f8f8f8;
      border-radius: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .legend-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .legend-dot {
      width: 12px;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .section {
      margin-bottom: 60px;
    }

    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #1F30E9;
    }

    .section-num {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      line-height: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      background: #1F30E9;
      color: white;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .sub {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .sub-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .screen-id {
      display: inline-block;
      min-width: 60px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      background: #EFF6FF;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1F30E9;
    }

    .screen-name {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .desc-wrap {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .desc-wrap-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #999;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    }

    .desc-card {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      background: #f8f8f8;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    .desc-card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .desc-card-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      background: #EFF6FF;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1F30E9;
    }

    .desc-card-name {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
    }

    .desc-card-body {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #666;
    }

    .desc-item {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .desc-item.depth2 {
      margin-left: 16px;
      color: #999;
    }

    .spec-wrap {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .spec-wrap-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #999;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
    }

    .spec-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .spec-table thead {
      background: #f0f4ff;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #1F30E9;
    }

    .spec-table th {
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1F30E9;
    }

    .spec-table td {
      padding: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
      color: #666;
    }

    .spec-table tr:hover {
      background: #f8f8f8;
    }

    .confirmed {
      background: #DCFCE7 !important;
      color: #065F46 !important;
      border: 1px solid #86EFAC;
    }

    .undefined {
      background: #FFF7ED !important;
      color: #C2410C !important;
      border: 1px solid #FED7AA;
    }

    .later {
      background: #F5F3FF !important;
      color: #6D28D9 !important;
      border: 1px solid #DDD6FE;
    }

    .rule-box {
      padding: 16px;
      background: #f0f4ff;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1F30E9;
    }

    .info-box {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: #FFF7ED;
      border-left: 3px solid #FED7AA;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #C2410C;
    }

    .sub-h3 {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 20px 0 12px 0;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-right: 4px;
    }

    .badge-open {
      background: #f0f4ff;
      color: #1F30E9;
      border: 1px solid #BFDBFE;
    }

    .badge-closed {
      background: #FEE2E2;
      color: #991B1B;
      border: 1px solid #FECACA;
    }

    .badge-settled {
      background: #DCFCE7;
      color: #065F46;
      border: 1px solid #86EFAC;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1200px) {
      .sidebar {
        width: 200px;
      }

      .layout {
        margin-left: 200px;
      }

      .main {
        padding: 30px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .sidebar {
        display: none;
      }

      .layout {
        margin-left: 0;
      }

      .topbar {
        padding: 0 16px;
      }

      .main {
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .cover {
        padding: 30px 20px;
      }

      .cover h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .cover-meta {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- 상단 네비게이션 바 -->
  <div class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-logo">PolyBall</div>
    <div class="topbar-version">v1.0</div>
  </div>

  <!-- 사이드바 -->
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-group">
      <div class="sidebar-group-label">전체 보기</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item active" onclick="scrollToSection('all')">
        <span class="sidebar-item-id">ALL</span>전체
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-group">
      <div class="sidebar-group-label">기능 요구사항</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="scrollToSection('01')">
        <span class="sidebar-item-id">01</span>회차별 목록 노출
      </button>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="scrollToSection('02')">
        <span class="sidebar-item-id">02</span>선택 내역 변경
      </button>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="scrollToSection('03')">
        <span class="sidebar-item-id">03</span>선택지 노출 및 선택률
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-divider"></div>
    <div class="sidebar-group">
      <div class="sidebar-group-label">개발 체크리스트</div>
      <button class="sidebar-item" onclick="scrollToSection('checklist')">
        <span class="sidebar-item-id">✓</span>체크리스트
      </button>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- 메인 콘텐츠 -->
  <div class="layout">
    <main class="main">
      <!-- 표지 -->
      <div class="cover">
        <div class="cover-tag">SPEC · v1.0</div>
        <h1>월드컵 예측 마켓</h1>
        <div class="cover-sub">이벤트 마켓 기능 요구사항</div>
        <div class="cover-meta">
          <div class="cover-meta-item">
            <span>프로젝트</span>
            <span>폴리볼 월드컵 이벤트</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cover-meta-item">
            <span>최종 수정</span>
            <span>2026-06-16</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cover-meta-item">
            <span>버전</span>
            <span>v1.0</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 범례 -->
      <div class="legend">
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-dot" style="background:#DCFCE7;border:1px solid #86EFAC;"></div>확정
        </div>
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-dot" style="background:#FFF7ED;border:1px solid #FED7AA;"></div>미정의
        </div>
        <div class="legend-item">
          <div class="legend-dot" style="background:#F5F3FF;border:1px solid #DDD6FE;"></div>추후 결정
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 요구사항 01 -->
      <div class="section" id="01">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-num">01</span>
          <span class="section-title">마켓 정산 완료 시 회차별 목록 노출</span>
        </div>

        <div class="sub">
          <div class="desc-wrap">
            <div class="desc-wrap-label">변경 내용</div>
            <div class="desc-card">
              <div class="desc-card-header">
                <span class="desc-card-tag">ASIS</span>
                <span class="desc-card-name">현재 상태</span>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-card-body">
                <div class="desc-item">정산 완료(settled) 마켓은 진행 목록에서 필터 아웃</div>
                <div class="desc-item">마이 &gt; 예측 히스토리에서만 확인 가능</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="desc-card">
              <div class="desc-card-header">
                <span class="desc-card-tag">TOBE</span>
                <span class="desc-card-name">요구 상태</span>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-card-body">
                <div class="desc-item">월드컵 이벤트 페이지 내 회차별 탭 구성</div>
                <div class="desc-item">정산 여부 무관하게 각 회차 탭 내에 노출</div>
                <div class="desc-item">참여 여부, 결과 발표 여부 상관없이 모두 노출</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-wrap">
            <div class="spec-wrap-label">적용 범위</div>
            <table class="spec-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>항목</th>
                  <th>상세</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>이벤트 페이지</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">월드컵 예측 이벤트 페이지 (별도 랜딩)</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>회차 구분</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">[조별리그 1차] [조별리그 2차] [조별리그 3차] [16강] [8강] [결승] 등</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>카드 노출 조건</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">참여 여부, 결과 발표 여부, 정산 완료 여부 무관 노출</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-wrap">
            <div class="spec-wrap-label">카드 노출 상태</div>
            <table class="spec-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>상태</th>
                  <th>버튼</th>
                  <th>표기</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td><span class="badge badge-open">진행 중 (open)</span></td>
                  <td class="confirmed">선택지 버튼 활성</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">-</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><span class="badge badge-closed">마감됨 (closed)</span></td>
                  <td class="confirmed">선택지 버튼 비활성</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">"마감" 배지</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td><span class="badge badge-settled">정산 완료 (settled)</span></td>
                  <td class="confirmed">선택지 버튼 비활성</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">정답 ✓ + 적중/오답 표기</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 요구사항 02 -->
      <div class="section" id="02">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-num">02</span>
          <span class="section-title">선택 내역 변경 가능 (마감 시간까지)</span>
        </div>

        <div class="sub">
          <div class="desc-wrap">
            <div class="desc-wrap-label">변경 내용</div>
            <div class="desc-card">
              <div class="desc-card-header">
                <span class="desc-card-tag">ASIS</span>
                <span class="desc-card-name">현재 상태</span>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-card-body">
                <div class="desc-item">이벤트 마켓 선택 완료 후 변경 불가</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="desc-card">
              <div class="desc-card-header">
                <span class="desc-card-tag">TOBE</span>
                <span class="desc-card-name">요구 상태</span>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-card-body">
                <div class="desc-item">선택 완료 후에도 마감 시간 도래 전까지 자유롭게 재선택 가능</div>
                <div class="desc-item">마지막 선택이 최종 예측으로 저장</div>
                <div class="desc-item">마감 도달 시 자동으로 버튼 비활성화</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-wrap">
            <div class="spec-wrap-label">적용 조건</div>
            <table class="spec-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>항목</th>
                  <th>상세</th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr>
                  <td>재선택 가능 시점</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">marketStatus === 'open' 상태에서만</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>재선택 후 저장</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">마지막 선택이 최종 예측으로 덮어씌워짐</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>마감 처리</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">마감 시간 도달 시 자동으로 버튼 비활성화</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td>모달 표시</td>
                  <td class="confirmed">이벤트마켓은 확정 모달 미사용, 즉시 변경</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <div class="rule-box">
            <strong>중요:</strong> 이전 선택 기록은 마지막 선택으로 덮어씌워지며, 선택지 버튼이 참여 완료 후에도 활성 상태 유지됨.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 요구사항 03 -->
      <div class="section" id="03">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-num">03</span>
          <span class="section-title">선택지 노출 및 선택률 표기</span>
        </div>

        <div class="sub">
          <div class="desc-wrap">
            <div class="desc-wrap-label">변경 내용</div>
            <div class="desc-card">
              <div class="desc-card-header">
                <span class="desc-card-tag">ASIS</span>
                <span class="desc-card-name">현재 상태</span>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-card-body">
                <div class="desc-item">선택지: 2×N 구조 (2열)</div>
                <div class="desc-item">목록 카드: 선택률 미노출</div>
                <div class="desc-item">선택률 확인: 상세 진입 &gt; "예측 현황" 탭에서만</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="desc-card">
              <div class="desc-card-header">
                <span class="desc-card-tag">TOBE</span>
                <span class="desc-card-name">요구 상태</span>
              </div>
              <div class="desc-card-body">
                <div class="desc-item">선택지: 1×N 구조 (1열, 세로 나열)</div>
                <div class="desc-item">참여 전: 선택지만 노출, 선택률 미표기</div>
                <div class="desc-item">참여 후: 목록 카드에서 각 선택지 옆 선택률(%) 실시간 노출</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="spec-wrap">
            <div class="spec-wrap-label">레이아웃 및 선택률 노출</div>
            <table class="spec-table">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th>상태</th>
                  <th>레이아웃</th>
